<header class="log-entry-header"><p class="kicker">Engineering log / 006</p><h1>Actor-native LLM architectures: building neural networks with Oreslang</h1><LogPrompt prompt={prompt} label="The architecture question" /><div class="log-entry-meta"><span>Authored by <strong>Alex Mills</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><time datetime="2026-10-14">October 14, 2026</time></div><p class="log-entry-intro">Actors can own, route, and supervise neural computation—but GPU tensors must still do the heavy lifting. An engineering plan for testing that boundary.</p></header>
